 "structural_change": "11 flat routes of ot_qwen_die_io_xfifo failed (setup -548..-852 ps, hold repair flooded 26k-65k endpoints: 62,971 flops + 16,384 receive-buffer bits on four roots over 400-700 x 1,564 um).  The slot is now a leaf partition: ONE hardened 1,024-bit channel master qfd_xf_ch (ot_qwen_die_cdc_ch W 1024 PIPE 2 unchanged, 19,569 sinks on two roots in 138.24 x 172.8, pin relay / pin station on every data pin) instantiated 8 times + the collective local-port leaf, under a wires-only parent.",
 "slot_change_request": "r3b 10-13: qfd_io_xfifo (700.248 x 1,563.816) becomes a wires-only cluster of 8 x qfd_xf_ch 138.24 x 172.8 (W: i_d[1023:0] y 8-160 + i_v / i_cr / w_fault, E: o_d[1023:0] y 8-160 + o_v / o_cr / r_fault, M4; N: wck, rck, rst_n M5) + the collective port leaf; every bundle of the slot gains its _v / _cr bits and the 16 channel fault bits leave unmerged (packing table in el1011-qwen-tp8.log).",
